tools.example:
Application Library: Corrosion_Module/Cathodic_Protection/anode_film_resistance and Electrodeposition_Module car_door (film on a thin electrode).
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("es1").set("FilmResistanceType", "SurfaceResistance");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("es1").set("Rf", "R_film");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Thermal_Management/jelly_roll (Secondary Current Distribution with porous electrodes).
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("pce1").create("per1", "PorousElectrodeReaction", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("pce1").feature("per1").set("av", "1e5[1/m]");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("pce1").feature("per1").set("i0", "10[A/m^2]");

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module car_door (electrophoretic-type paint deposition on a car door).
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").create("tes1", "ThinElectrodeSurface", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("tes1").set("SideSelection", "Both");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("tes1").set("FilmResistanceType", "ThicknessAndConductivity");

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module pcb_aperture_optimization (insulating shield optimized for uniform plating).
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").create("tel1", "ThinElectrolyteLayer", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("tel1").set("ThinLayerType", "Insulating");

Application Library: Corrosion_Module pipeline_corrosion_protection_iccp and stray_current_train.
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").create("edge1", "EdgeElectrode", 1);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("edge1").selection().set(new int[]{12});

Application Library: Corrosion_Module localized_corrosion_ls (Electrolyte Current Source representing dissolution in a pit).
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").create("ics1", "ElectrolyteCurrentSource", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("ics1").set("Qli", "i_loc*ls.delta");

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module resistive_wafer (secondary initialization) and Battery_Design_Module li_battery_1d.
model.study().create("std1");
model.study("std1").create("cdi", "CurrentDistributionInitialization");
model.study("std1").feature("cdi").set("initType", "secondary");
model.study("std1").create("time", "Transient");
model.study("std1").feature("time").set("tlist", "range(0,10,3600)");
